{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段影片，一名乘客搭乘一輛疑由屯門開往旺角的小巴期間，見司機高速駕駛，車速警報器不時「咇咇」作響，車速更高達每小時 111 公里。小巴甚至在高速入彎時完全不見減速，車身「掟到側晒」，震撼畫面令網民直呼驚心動魄。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-16h20m58s990.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026rVGBGTLGNe1789460660.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-16h20m58s990.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片引起熱議，網民紛紛質疑司機的危險行為：「亡命小巴」、「好危險！」、「開到92-113，超晒速，一炒車，好Q大獲。」；亦有心驚膽戰的網民形容司機過彎：「掟灣掟到側曬」、「隻隻彎都咁入」。面對不斷飆升的車速數字與蜂鳴聲，更有網民發揮幽默本色調侃：「上面嗰個數字，係心跳嘅速度！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-15h26m38s8331.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gzxTXHGQmG1789460673.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-15h26m38s8331.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:53.955474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}